    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>AB</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8594;</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi>a&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfe